{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>「你知道，這裏面涉及性，而性比股票更能吸引眼球。」特朗普説道。</p>\n<p>特朗普同時透露，黃仁勳與妻子洛麗（Lori Huang）已經解決了兩人之間的問題。洛麗是英偉達的重要股東，自相關爭議曝光以來尚未公開發表講話。</p>\n<p>特朗普在採訪中連續使用三個「非常」評價洛麗：「他有一位非常、非常、非常好的妻子，他們已經解決了這些問題。她是一位很棒的女性。」</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/tech/transform/114/w550h364/20261124/cca0-97fcca1a34acc78365890dce90f42209.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.465531+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:41:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:17:18.798215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:18.566779+00:00","content_hash":"d94083017a35d3031931e8c0c70c4a4ded231b026b67c6088a4887789b0fdba3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}